boundary_suggestions.before_suggestion:
Expressions (8-45) and (8-46) apply not only to a uniform electrostatic field between parallel plates, but also describe the energy density at each point in a nonuniform electrostatic field.
Their range of validity, however, is limited to a vacuum or a linear, isotropic, nondispersive dielectric with negligible losses;
this conclusion must not be taken to apply to every material.
